  "version": 1,
  "_": "Knowledge about other tools, not about this repo, so it ships with the package. A machine's own exception belongs in that repo's .addone/config.json. Every field carries how it was obtained: `measured` means someone ran it, `read` means someone read the official documentation without running it, `unknown` means nobody has looked. A candidate binary name with how=unknown is still tried, because trying costs nothing and a hit is new knowledge.",
